    <string name="tasks_voice_guide_title">Create a task by voice</string>
    <string name="tasks_voice_guide_body">After you start, say one field at a time: 1) a category or “no category”, 2) the task title, 3) a Persian date or “skip”, 4) hour and minute or “skip”, and 5) low, normal, high, or urgent priority. You can repeat a field, skip it, or cancel the whole flow.</string>
    <string name="tasks_voice_guide_example">Example: “Home” → “Buy a gift” → “25 Aban 1405” → “14:30” → “High”</string>
    <string name="tasks_voice_guide_privacy">Speech is processed by Android’s installed speech-recognition service. Availability and network use depend on that service. MarbleDo does not store your audio.</string>
